&lt;p&gt;The Senior Audit Finance (Financial Reporting) supports the financial reporting, consolidation, and regulatory compliance functions within a fast-growing FinTech environment. This role ensures accurate and timely reporting while navigating complex financial products, digital transactions, and evolving regulatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare monthly, quarterly, and annual financial statements in accordance with IFRS.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform variance analysis and provide insights on revenue streams (e.g., transaction fees, interest income)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accuracy and integrity of high-volume digital transaction data (e.g., payments, wallets platforms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support regulatory reporting requirements (e.g., submissions to central banks or financial authorities)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in preparing reports for stakeholders &amp;amp; day-to-day operations and team management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product, Operations, and Tech teams to understand financial data flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and execute ad hoc assignments, strategic initiatives, and cross-functional projects as directed by management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise and guide team members to ensure performance targets are met&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor workflow, productivity, and quality of output.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement AI-driven tools to automate repetitive reporting tasks, enhance the analysis of high-volume digital transaction data, and improve the overall efficiency of the finance function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Finance, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional certification (e.g., CPA, ACCA, CA) preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-4 years of experience in financial reporting, preferably in FinTech, banking, or audit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of IFRS (experience with financial instruments is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with digital payments, lending, or blockchain-based products is advantageous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ERP systems and data tools (e.g., SAP, Oracle, SQL, Power BI) - Preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset with ability to interpret large datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail in a fast-paced, high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech-savvy mindset with an interest in using AI productivity tools to streamline financial workflows, improve data accuracy, and support faster decision-making in a high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial reporting &amp;amp; consolidation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of FinTech business models (payments, lending, wallets)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regulatory compliance awareness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data analytics and automation mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional collaboration (Finance + Tech + Product)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting Line&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reports to: Associate Director&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_2989597180337834284gmail-m_4972969247898306296gmail-docs-internal-guid-3a65a3c2-7fff-88ff-9e94-8ab11a050d04&quot;&gt;Razorpay believes in and follows an equal employment opportunity policy that doesn&#39;t discriminate on gender, religion, sexual orientation, colour, nationality, age, etc. We welcome interests and applications from all groups and communities across the globe. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
